&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:37pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h5 class="smt_head4" style="line-height:13pt;"&gt;②　役員区分ごとの報酬等の総額、報酬等の種類別の総額及び対象となる役員の員数&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:10pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:434.3pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width:113.3pt;min-width:113.3pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:66pt;min-width:66pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:63pt;min-width:63pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:63pt;min-width:63pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:63pt;min-width:63pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:66pt;min-width:66pt;"/&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:13.5pt;min-height:13.5pt;"&gt;
